{"parentUuid":"6c201468-4c99-4d69-b9f0-dc4d9b924067","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b6785fd-5407-4f1d-b1fa-397a6ca50e91","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Da9sYdjFDK3gq89BitkWvV","type":"tool_result","content":"Location: crates/core/src/resolver/mod.rs:1035\n\nA factory render callback annotated with a named interface containing 201 own members has those members collapsed under the default configuration. `resolve_base_as_chain` increments the depth for named types (`alias.rs:328`), bypassing the depth-zero protection in `ResolutionContext::collapses`, so `chain.rs:592` treats these own props as inherited; the equivalent inline annotation stays expanded. Resolve the callback’s root props declaration at depth zero while allowing its bases to collapse.\n\nLocation: crates/core/src/extractor/factory_props.rs:34-41\n\nFor a component-returning helper such as `makeButton(node, (settings: { debug: boolean }) => {})`, this treats the setup callback’s parameter as component props without establishing that it renders anything. The merge in `resolver/mod.rs:1034–1037` then adds a required `debug` prop that the returned component never accepts. Require render-function evidence before interpreting the callback’s annotation as props.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cb8290c6-a0b2-4cc2-9363-30c94cececf6","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:19:39.869Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Location: crates/core/src/resolver/mod.rs:1035\n\nA factory render callback annotated with a named interface containing 201 own members has those members collapsed under the default configuration. `resolve_base_as_chain` increments the depth for named types (`alias.rs:328`), bypassing the depth-zero protection in `ResolutionContext::collapses`, so `chain.rs:592` treats these own props as inherited; the equivalent inline annotation stays expanded. Resolve the callback’s root props declaration at depth zero while allowing its bases to collapse.\n\nLocation: crates/core/src/extractor/factory_props.rs:34-41\n\nFor a component-returning helper such as `makeButton(node, (settings: { debug: boolean }) => {})`, this treats the setup callback’s parameter as component props without establishing that it renders anything. The merge in `resolver/mod.rs:1034–1037` then adds a required `debug` prop that the returned component never accepts. Require render-function evidence before interpreting the callback’s annotation as props.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c43dd158-a1a7-41e0-a2f6-9d4798db0eec","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","branch":"fix-480-dep","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6c201468-4c99-4d69-b9f0-dc4d9b924067","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix-480-dep","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
