{"parentUuid":"12478dbd-c094-4e05-8d4f-88b2948f6067","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch683TygALMyB8GC97ghv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0172H5vkMDVkrp61EFg5c3F1","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"480: factory callback props declaration resolves at depth zero","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","isolation":"worktree","prompt":"Fix one finding on the factory-props code (change 281/278; branch `feat/factory-own-props`, PR 480, trail 405). `git fetch origin` (if blocked, use existing origin refs); start from `origin/feat/factory-own-props` (013278c4); local branch `fix/factory-depth-zero`; commit locally; I push. Read /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/worker-contract.md, then `entire trail finding show 01M7HF6H3X0Q --branch feat/relevance-output --repo gh/orin-dx/caliper --project gh/orin-dx` and crates/core/src/resolver/mod.rs (~1020-1040, where factory_props are resolved), resolver/alias.rs (~328 `resolve_base_as_chain` increments depth for named types), resolver/chain.rs (~592), and `ResolutionContext::collapses` (the depth-zero protection: a component's OWN props type is resolved at depth zero and is never collapsed). The finding: a factory render callback annotated with a NAMED interface containing 201 own members has those members collapsed under the default collapse config, because `resolve_base_as_chain` increments the depth for named types, bypassing the depth-zero protection; the inline annotation (`(props: { ...201 members })`) stays expanded. Fix: resolve the callback's ROOT props declaration at depth zero (so its own members are own and never collapse), while its bases/extended sources still can collapse as they do for a normal component whose props type is a named interface. Look at how a normal component `function C(props: Big) {}` gets depth zero for `Big`'s own members and reuse that entry point; do not add a second rule. Tests first (fail on base): a factory call `make('div', (props: Big) => <div />)` where `interface Big { m0..m200: string }` (201 own members, a loop-generated source string) lists all 201 under the default collapse config ('dependencies') and under 'all'; `interface Big extends Base201 {...}` keeps Big's own members listed and lets Base201's members collapse (as normal components); the inline-literal annotation unchanged. Gates (targeted): `pnpm install --offline --ignore-scripts --frozen-lockfile` in the worktree first; `just lint doc-check machete typos`; nextest `-p caliper-docgen-core -p caliper-docgen-semantic`. Then run `/code-review low` once and AWAIT its output; fix only real bugs. Own CARGO_TARGET_DIR under /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/shrink/, rust 1.99.1 first on PATH (/Users/gabe/.rustup/toolchains/1.99.1-aarch64-apple-darwin/bin). Cap 40 tool calls. Final message at most 40 words: branch, SHA, exit codes."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":671393,"output_tokens":1804,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":590},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":711,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1804,"cache_read_input_tokens":671393,"cache_creation_input_tokens":711,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":711},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_0172H5vkMDVkrp61EFg5c3F1":{"description":"480: factory callback props declaration resolves at depth zero","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","isolation":"worktree","prompt":"Fix one finding on the factory-props code (change 281/278; branch `feat/factory-own-props`, PR 480, trail 405). `git fetch origin` (if blocked, use existing origin refs); start from `origin/feat/factory-own-props` (013278c4); local branch `fix/factory-depth-zero`; commit locally; I push. Read /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/worker-contract.md, then `entire trail finding show 01M7HF6H3X0Q --branch feat/relevance-output --repo gh/orin-dx/caliper --project gh/orin-dx` and crates/core/src/resolver/mod.rs (~1020-1040, where factory_props are resolved), resolver/alias.rs (~328 `resolve_base_as_chain` increments depth for named types), resolver/chain.rs (~592), and `ResolutionContext::collapses` (the depth-zero protection: a component's OWN props type is resolved at depth zero and is never collapsed). The finding: a factory render callback annotated with a NAMED interface containing 201 own members has those members collapsed under the default collapse config, because `resolve_base_as_chain` increments the depth for named types, bypassing the depth-zero protection; the inline annotation (`(props: { ...201 members })`) stays expanded. Fix: resolve the callback's ROOT props declaration at depth zero (so its own members are own and never collapse), while its bases/extended sources still can collapse as they do for a normal component whose props type is a named interface. Look at how a normal component `function C(props: Big) {}` gets depth zero for `Big`'s own members and reuse that entry point; do not add a second rule. Tests first (fail on base): a factory call `make('div', (props: Big) => <div />)` where `interface Big { m0..m200: string }` (201 own members, a loop-generated source string) lists all 201 under the default collapse config ('dependencies') and under 'all'; `interface Big extends Base201 {...}` keeps Big's own members listed and lets Base201's members collapse (as normal components); the inline-literal annotation unchanged. Gates (targeted): `pnpm install --offline --ignore-scripts --frozen-lockfile` in the worktree first; `just lint doc-check machete typos`; nextest `-p caliper-docgen-core -p caliper-docgen-semantic`. Then run `/code-review low` once and AWAIT its output; fix only real bugs. Own CARGO_TARGET_DIR under /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/shrink/, rust 1.99.1 first on PATH (/Users/gabe/.rustup/toolchains/1.99.1-aarch64-apple-darwin/bin). Cap 40 tool calls. Final message at most 40 words: branch, SHA, exit codes."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"60735c9a-aa29-4836-affd-67b54e95c644","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch683TgZxo3pK3V1N6KZZ","requestRef":"68da2ba2-de6f-4a7a-a166-ec6f76f628f9","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"87e7bed0-81cb-49da-8e1d-b4bebb604525","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:19:51.822Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix-480-dep","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
