{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","id":"21f77104-56dd-4c57-9b12-b775870c11cf","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:21:53.022Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"9803daf85cbe48be5f6ca225f95dc13bf2e5a024e85e5325762dd209c1ad3e02","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"9a81e30e-b572-4724-960c-4af712314c15","keep":1171,"tail":["885cc398c9550dc1167b8ba8992c465d349dd0f62e0a16ec1c7138d7618bfcc4","17f050680f5b7d92cd7a525ea238bd46f66f400464d08600eb9a8b9f37227812","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1173,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"76acd57aae7164a14e608616ea5ea8e3110bb1191bfc9f9296e437981b2ea5d3"}
{"parentUuid":"2d6b37c9-9a1a-41be-9e7d-ce359c958cb8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch68DH39FbRoygR7txQRK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"One of the two 281 findings is resolved. The other needs a code fix, and a worker is on it.\n\n**Change 278 (#480): one more fix, pushed as 013278c4**\n- **Finding:** a package type named only by a factory callback annotation, such as `make('div', (props: ExternalProps) => ...)`, stayed unresolved, because the dependency scan skipped `factory_props`. It now includes them.\n- **Test:** `a_package_type_named_only_by_a_factory_callback_annotation_is_loaded` fails without the fix and passes with it. Core lib tests pass (1078). I resolved the finding.\n\n**Change 281 (#483): two findings**\n1. **Setup callback treated as props** (`makeButton(node, (settings: { debug: boolean }) => {})` gets a phantom `debug` prop). **Resolved.** The fix was already in #480 as an allow-list: a callback counts as the render function only when it's proven to be one. #483 carried an older copy of #480's code. I merged current #480 into #483 and pushed it as 39646670.\n2. **Named own-props interface collapsed** (a factory callback annotated with a named interface of 201 own members gets them collapsed, because the named type bumps the depth and skips the depth-zero protection). **Open.** A Sonnet worker is fixing it on #480's branch, since the code lives there. The fix resolves the callback's root props declaration at depth zero, while its bases can still collapse. Tests are first and cover both the default setting and `all`. When it lands I push it and merge it into #483.\n\n**The merge into #483 had conflicts** in `cache.rs` and the golden snapshot. Both branches had bumped the cache version. I set it to 43, which adds a note for `factory_type_params`, and regenerated the golden snapshot. The full workspace nextest run passed: 1640 tests, none failing.\n\n**Merge order:** #480 first, then #483. Both stay blocked on that second finding."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":408,"cache_read_input_tokens":683832,"output_tokens":648,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":408,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":648,"cache_read_input_tokens":683832,"cache_creation_input_tokens":408,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":408},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7aeec411-040b-4c91-88e4-5cd8d2460fb0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch68DGiYYVVvxpzCixZXf","requestRef":"21f77104-56dd-4c57-9b12-b775870c11cf","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1eda9753-27b6-40b6-be7a-3ab2aec9c619","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:21:57.782Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/factory-depth-zero","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
