{"parentUuid":"a95f4ba8-8b73-4f79-93b0-f7369195909c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SLzBd55LE6v8uyiebX72s3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\n3\tcargo/caliper-docgen-semantic: minor\n4\tcargo/caliper-docgen: patch\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\tThe checker no longer converts the types of props that a collapsed inheritance layer holds. It reads only their names and where they are declared, so the output does not change. `SemanticTarget` has a new `layering` field (`None` converts every prop, as before), and `targets_collapsing` builds targets that carry it.\n8\t"}]},"uuid":"c6da0826-d083-4a73-aed1-5c02f3a6ac9a","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:31:59.600Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/skip-converting-collapsed-layer-props.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-semantic: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: patch\n---\n\nThe checker no longer converts the types of props that a collapsed inheritance layer holds. It reads only their names and where they are declared, so the output does not change. `SemanticTarget` has a new `layering` field (`None` converts every prop, as before), and `targets_collapsing` builds targets that carry it.\n","numLines":8,"startLine":1,"totalLines":8}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a95f4ba8-8b73-4f79-93b0-f7369195909c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
