{"parentUuid":"ea85aa66-55d1-4fbe-84ef-ce77310a7eb4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KbEcyDhvxW5BoVZvemHGiy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\n3\tcargo/caliper-docgen: minor\n4\tcargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n5\tnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\tThe structural answer (`--no-checker`, and what the checker lane keeps from it) now reads more prop types the way the checker does:\n9\t\n10\t- `React.ReactElement` and `JSX.Element` stay named `ReactElement` / `JSX.Element` instead of widening to `reactNode`.\n11\t"}]},"uuid":"a951c287-d406-457d-889f-10be6a8e652b","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:00.548Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/structural-parity-utility-and-generics.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\n---\n\nThe structural answer (`--no-checker`, and what the checker lane keeps from it) now reads more prop types the way the checker does:\n\n- `React.ReactElement` and `JSX.Element` stay named `ReactElement` / `JSX.Element` instead of widening to `reactNode`.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ea85aa66-55d1-4fbe-84ef-ce77310a7eb4","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
