{"parentUuid":"a8ef08fd-9858-4186-aaa4-135f614ac3b2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M72j5VgGRtHCzoom1Myk4f","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\n3\tcargo/caliper-docgen: minor\n4\tcargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n5\tnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\n6\tnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: minor\n7\tnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n8\tnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\tThe canonical JSON moves to schema version 8: a collapsed inheritance layer gains `used`, the names of its ambient members (declared by `@types/react` or Spectrum's shared DOM types) that consumers pass at the call-site floor or the component's body reads (ADR 0028). Which props are listed or collapsed does not change. `InheritedLayer` gains the public field `used`, so it can no longer be built with a struct expression that omits it, and `GlobalSourceData` a crate-internal field (each file's JSX outside component bodies). Watch and lazy sessions count call sites again for each revision, so an edit to a consumer reaches every component it renders. The Vite plugin, the Storybook addon and the scripts read version 8 only. The parse cache moves to version 42.\n12\t"}]},"uuid":"cee7946b-3766-42d5-9714-b76706d404e0","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:01.394Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/relevance-output.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\n---\n\nThe canonical JSON moves to schema version 8: a collapsed inheritance layer gains `used`, the names of its ambient members (declared by `@types/react` or Spectrum's shared DOM types) that consumers pass at the call-site floor or the component's body reads (ADR 0028). Which props are listed or collapsed does not change. `InheritedLayer` gains the public field `used`, so it can no longer be built with a struct expression that omits it, and `GlobalSourceData` a crate-internal field (each file's JSX outside component bodies). Watch and lazy sessions count call sites again for each revision, so an edit to a consumer reaches every component it renders. The Vite plugin, the Storybook addon and the scripts read version 8 only. The parse cache moves to version 42.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a8ef08fd-9858-4186-aaa4-135f614ac3b2","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
