{"parentUuid":"f80ff860-6b6f-44bf-86bf-b5f6b6ca4910","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Trmu2fvLLRUPHKNmWktEeu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n3\tnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n4\tnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: patch\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\tThe Storybook addon asks the TypeScript checker for the components of the stories next to the one shown after the story shown and before warm-up and fill work. When you open another story, the checker drops what it had queued for the stories next to the one you left, unless it already started; when you edit a file, the addon asks again for the stories next to the one shown, since the edit dropped what was queued. For binding users: `sessionPrefetch` asks at the neighbour class, and the new `sessionCancel(sessionId, keys)` drops the queued requests for `keys` that nobody waits for.\n8\t"}]},"uuid":"e098369b-0ab7-4c83-a63a-138de5d9fbfc","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:02.255Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/scheduler-addon-wiring.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: patch\n---\n\nThe Storybook addon asks the TypeScript checker for the components of the stories next to the one shown after the story shown and before warm-up and fill work. When you open another story, the checker drops what it had queued for the stories next to the one you left, unless it already started; when you edit a file, the addon asks again for the stories next to the one shown, since the edit dropped what was queued. For binding users: `sessionPrefetch` asks at the neighbour class, and the new `sessionCancel(sessionId, keys)` drops the queued requests for `keys` that nobody waits for.\n","numLines":8,"startLine":1,"totalLines":8}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f80ff860-6b6f-44bf-86bf-b5f6b6ca4910","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
