{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","prNumber":483,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/483","prRepository":"orin-dx/caliper","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:44.529Z"}
{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":15975,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"c7266584-f843-420b-aed0-fab8bd3e0a77","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch693J7inMbRm55WGYmzY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No, the changesets are not release-ready. Yes, an oracle run before the release is right, but not yet.\n\n**Changesets.** Every merged topic has a file, but they don't follow the AGENTS.md convention. I read all ten.\n\nThe problems:\n- **Written for the implementer:** they list struct fields, `SemanticTarget.layering`, cache schema numbers (\"moves to 39\", \"42\", now 43), `ComponentMapping::new`, and ADR numbers.\n- **No bold lead-in naming the change as the user sees it, and no scannable bullets.** They're dense single paragraphs.\n- **The breaking change isn't marked.** The addon's default flipping from `'none'` to `'dependencies'` is buried mid-paragraph, not in a `**Breaking:**` paragraph with an `**Action:**` line.\n- **Stale facts:**\n  - The factory changeset still stops at the first version of that work (no defaults, no discriminated unions, no dependency types).\n  - The parity changeset talks about expansion we deleted.\n  - Relevance-output cites cache version 42.\n- **Missing:** nothing covers #485 (own props kept next to React types, no double listing, unresolved `Omit` not collapsed).\n\nI started a Sonnet worker (40 calls) to rewrite them to the convention, add the #485 changeset, drop internals, and check the docs for any \"default is `none`\" statement. It runs lint, doc-check, machete, typos and `just semver`. It will open as one docs PR when it reports.\n\n**Oracle run before the release.** I'd say yes, from a fresh `main`, once main's CI is green. The weekly oracle and the corpora gate on the release PR didn't run before 0.11.0, which is how the regression shipped.\n\nState of `main` now:\n- **Merged:** everything except #487, the Wisp v5 chore.\n- **CI on the #483 merge (de016f69):** in progress. #480's run was cancelled because the #483 merge superseded it.\n- **Release & Publish:** failed on the #479 merge in the \"Execute approved release\" step. I suspect it's the unfinished 0.11.0 release re-running each time, the E167 asset digest conflict from before, but I haven't confirmed that.\n\n**The oracle run costs real money, so I'm not starting it.** My recommendation is to run it once, from the SHA that has green CI.\n\n**What I need from you:** say \"run the oracle\" and I'll wait for green CI on de016f69 first. Or tell me to look at that Release & Publish failure first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6842,"cache_read_input_tokens":707441,"output_tokens":835,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6842,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":835,"cache_read_input_tokens":707441,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6842},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"64401f05-0e8d-48fb-a1b7-505470cbd088","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch693HprjAmKpKBpPCeLG","requestRef":"90f12a8b-5728-4c34-91ab-1a5cf98a370b","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e0b4ad3-15b8-400f-8668-2a80c5d20f73","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:51.714Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","git