{"parentUuid":"ec536561-2a6c-4951-8168-9bfc0730062e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch69EV6KLjaioiSX9iC7j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_read_input_tokens":729939,"output_tokens":1333,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":155},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1333,"cache_read_input_tokens":729939,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7207,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"0912fba4-d3ec-4799-850f-417fe61e9a27","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch69EUg2QZvfmA8C8PF58","requestRef":"3f1c74fb-e0c9-49cb-8311-896de84290bc","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f50323c-5482-4e97-9b46-6b78db069cb6","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:35:24.231Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
{"parentUuid":"2f50323c-5482-4e97-9b46-6b78db069cb6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch69EV6KLjaioiSX9iC7j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's nothing in the repo that defines \"alpha\" yet. `docs/releasing.md`, the README and CONTRIBUTING have no pre-release channel, npm dist-tag or label. Here is what I'd wrap up, grouped by what blocks an alpha. I'm assuming the Storybook addon is the product (see the decisions below).\n\n## Proposed bar for an alpha\n\nSomeone installs the Storybook addon on a real design system and gets correct Controls fast on the first start and the second. We tell them plainly what is missing. Stability and an API freeze are not part of this bar.\n\n## Must be true before an alpha\n\n1. **Measured numbers on current `main`.** The oracle run is in progress and covers:\n   - Performance on the first and second run, per corpus, against the budgets.\n   - Output quality, including the oracle's right-rate.\n   - Storybook dev mode timings.\n\n   The bar is no regression from 0.11.0 and no budget breach. If Chakra memory or time is over budget, that blocks the alpha.\n2. **A release that publishes.** Callisto's \"Execute approved release\" step fails on every `main` run. I think it's the unfinished 0.11.0 release (the E167 asset digest conflict) being retried. I haven't confirmed that. Until it's understood, nothing publishes.\n3. **The corpora budget gate on the release PR works.** Its dispatch step is new and has never run on a real release PR.\n4. **User-facing changesets.** A worker is rewriting them to the AGENTS.md convention, with the breaking default change marked.\n5. **Documentation matches the code.**\n   - `docs/STATUS.md` is dated 2026-11-12 and its speed numbers predate collapse.\n   - `storybook-parity.md` and the addon docs still describe `collapseInheritedProps: none` as the default.\n   - `MIGRATING.md` needs an \"Upgrading the addon default\" note.\n6. **Honest limits in the README.** For example, `used` is empty on the Chakra and gate-large corpora (the worker's T7b finding), the checker-only alias `Pick` limit is gone but the other known gaps remain in `edge-cases.md`, and the output schema is still moving.\n\n## Would improve the alpha, but doesn't block it\n\n- **T4, the Storybook consumer.** Relevance data is computed and in the output (`used`), but the addon doesn't use it to choose which Controls to show. Without it, collapse is the only narrowing. For an alpha that's acceptable if we say so.\n- **Head-to-head with react-docgen-typescript on dev-mode time to Controls.** The oracle run includes dev mode, but only partly compares with RDT.\n- **Entire's findings.** Everything is resolved today. New ones may arrive on the changeset PR.\n\n## Decisions I need from you\n\n1. **What \"alpha\" means:**\n   - An npm `alpha` dist-tag, which needs Callisto to support it. I haven't checked.\n   - Or a normal 0.12.0 minor release labeled alpha in the README.\n2. **Audience for the alpha:** internal teams, a few design-system maintainers, or public.\n3. **Is the addon default flip (`'none'` to `'dependencies'`) acceptable in the first alpha,** or should it be opt-in until T4 lands?\n\nI'd start on the release pipeline failure (item 2) now, since it blocks any publish and I don't yet know the cause. The oracle run and the changeset rewrite are already moving, so your answer to question 1 is the only thing item 1 of the plan waits on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_read_input_tokens":729939,"output_tokens":1333,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":155},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1333,"cache_read_input_tokens":729939,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0912fba4-d3ec-4799-850f-417fe61e9a27","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch69EUg2QZvfmA8C8PF58","requestRef":"3f1c74fb-e0c9-49cb-8311-896de84290bc","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"db524f13-35e3-4549-86a0-14019255d8f7","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:35:27.990Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
