{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","id":"ce6907f5-acd7-4884-a696-980c0309564e","timestamp":"2026-11-16T07:15:08.942Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"9803daf85cbe48be5f6ca225f95dc13bf2e5a024e85e5325762dd209c1ad3e02","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"b7693c37-728e-43de-8261-1eaaa3dd6352","keep":1315,"tail":["3c3920f5c5abf7c8fe31139e12fbc04e23001b8300f7e55bcd22245f1aa7cac1","7ddffc9a25a305765c885d744fdf435ce95489faf38a4c30f2c9eee03c1917ed","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1317,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"4756481049f9528fbb70ab75b3a26ba6d88de1ab541d27b21963a9da71b2ef7a"}
{"parentUuid":"17f43b19-bf75-4961-9cad-71fa7937b7b0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch6CGs2Lrk2dLmFVDikC7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The alpha docs are up as #489 (base `main`, trail 405).\n\n**What it adds**\n- **`MIGRATING.md`:** an \"Upgrading the Storybook addon\" section. It covers the `collapseInheritedProps` default moving from `'none'` to `'dependencies'`, what changes in Controls, and how to opt out.\n- **Addon README:** a \"Known limits (alpha)\" list of six items. I read them and they match what I know of the code.\n  - A prop inside a collapsed layer has no Controls row.\n  - The structural answer comes first and the checker's replaces it.\n  - The output schema (version 8) can change between alphas.\n  - Wrapper calls with no type argument, like `createIconLoader('x')`, aren't recognized.\n  - Edits to dependency declarations outside the source directories aren't noticed until Storybook restarts.\n  - Symlinked directories under a source directory aren't followed, with no diagnostic.\n\n**What it left out.** Two candidates were dropped because the docs contradict or don't support them: description loss for checker-only props, and a tsconfig requirement.\n\n**Not verified.**\n- `just doc-check machete typos` passed. `just lint` failed in the worker's sandbox because pnpm needs the registry, so CI runs it.\n- I haven't read the `MIGRATING.md` section in full.\n- The README's \"0.7 to 2.9 s\" figure for Chakra's `Button` without prefetch comes from the worker citing existing docs. The oracle run will give a current number to check it against.\n\n**Alpha state:**\n- **Done, in review:** changesets (#488) and these docs (#489).\n- **In progress:** the oracle run. CLI numbers are in. Storybook dev mode and the clean re-timing are not.\n- **Waiting on you:** the 0.11.0 release recovery, either deleting the mismatched asset and re-dispatching or skipping with `RELEASE_PENDING_FROM`. Also the other two alpha decisions: the audience, and whether the addon default flip ships in the first alpha.\n- **After the oracle:** refresh the `STATUS.md` speed numbers from it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":470,"cache_read_input_tokens":761635,"output_tokens":711,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":470,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":761635,"cache_creation_input_tokens":470,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":470},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f097af87-7bbd-4356-b28a-419b79797d43","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch6CGrdGfgMd7PRnUqiVH","requestRef":"ce6907f5-acd7-4884-a696-980c0309564e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5c95b219-6755-4185-a398-5559a9d486dd","timestamp":"2026-11-16T07:15:13.962Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
