{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","id":"39511d92-417f-407e-9525-9c98a746e235","timestamp":"2026-11-16T08:11:28.551Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"9803daf85cbe48be5f6ca225f95dc13bf2e5a024e85e5325762dd209c1ad3e02","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"03021870-1a05-4b00-bc85-6cc90705177d","keep":1337,"tail":["1ee83742199791c05e9df1c74bdef5610dd139199e8a277b1cfaa5dd65621849","506da03f64de4d1ebafc819ab7542504e66dd18a81d6dfd628ff4e5f0e499bc4","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1339,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"8117858f89a07613670e38f365f732510af2b943d71430283826b810aeebe441"}
{"attachment":{"entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[],"type":"deferred_tools_record"},"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"mf6-483","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"d8f29cb0-2fb6-46af-8d9d-dec9c129dea6","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano","timestamp":"2026-11-16T08:11:35.539Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"5db66187-4d20-4739-ae78-d9f931cefcda","version":"2.1.311"}
{"parentUuid":"5db66187-4d20-4739-ae78-d9f931cefcda","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch6GZzBPxL2SHUdoBsuZ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Chakra now has a headline, and it adds a measurement gap to the quality picture. The report file exists, because I wrote it from the worker's earlier message after its own write was refused. I've now added the Chakra row to it.\n\n**Chakra's oracle result** (rerun with a 16 GB Node heap, exit 0): 620 components and 486,834 props.\n\n| Verdict | Props | Share |\n|---|---|---|\n| Correct | 81,451 | 16.7% |\n| Less precise | 37,951 | 7.8% |\n| Wrong | 0 | 0% |\n| Not judged | 367,432 | 75.5% |\n\nOn the same props RDT has 10 wrong, and 96.8% of what it lists agrees with the checker.\n\n**What it means.** Mantine (32.7% correct, 63% not judged) shows the same pattern. On both, almost all the drop from 0.10.0 is \"not judged\", with 0 wrong before and after. So the oracle isn't saying those types are wrong. It leaves most props on the two biggest style-system corpora unchecked, and the headline can't tell us their quality. Nobody has found why.\n\nMy guess, not verified: types cut to their name by the size bound from PR 468 can't be compared, and Chakra's style-prop types are the huge ones. If so, \"not judged\" is the correct verdict for those props.\n\n**The honest quality picture for an alpha**\n- **Wrong props:** zero on Chakra, Mantine and shadcn, 1 on antd, and 7 on Spectrum out of 17,016.\n- **Right-rate:** 98.7% on shadcn, 93.0% on antd and 88.4% on Spectrum.\n- **Chakra and Mantine:** unmeasured until the oracle can judge the cut types.\n- **Weekly oracle step:** it needs the larger Node heap on Chakra, or it dies at about 4 GB.\n\n**Where this leaves the alpha list**\n1. **The `@types/react` contract fix.** I recommended option 2 (ambient React layer plus the 17 notables, `Button` at about 167 rows, both lanes agreeing). It is waiting on your go-ahead.\n2. **Weekly oracle:** the Node heap setting, and either judging the cut types or reporting \"not judged\" separately so the headline isn't misleading.\n3. **Everything from before:** the release recovery for 0.11.0, the changesets (#488), the docs (#489), your audience and addon-default decisions, and a clean re-timing on an idle machine.\n\nWhich of these do you want first? I'd start the contract fix, since it changes what users see."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":802524,"output_tokens":857,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":557,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":802524,"cache_creation_input_tokens":557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":557},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0455cf9d-4e3a-4376-bb8c-37766b5e06a6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch6GZyqoN8vuYrN2sHCKi","requestRef":"39511d92-417f-407e-9525-9c98a746e235","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"242894a2-cec8-4040-a2aa-310e08b4a910","timestamp":"2026-11-16T08:11:35.537Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
